AArch64 MP+popl+casal-fail-po
"MP: STR; STLR flag. Reader: failing CASAL on the flag (comparand 2), then LDR. A failing CASA/CASAL still reads with acquire"
{
0:X1=x; 0:X3=y;
1:X3=y; 1:X5=x;
}
 P0           | P1               ;
 MOV W0,#1    | MOV W1,#2        ;
 STR W0,[X1]  | MOV W2,#3        ;
 STLR W0,[X3] | CASAL W1,W2,[X3] ;
              | LDR W4,[X5]      ;
exists (1:X1=1 /\ 1:X4=0)
